OL,3,AVictoria Beckham's company makes its
OL,4,Afirst profit after 18 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've been very transparent about the
OL,7,Fproblems that we had in the business
OL,8,Fbut have recovered and are now growing
OL,9,Fat a sensible pace. After 20 years,
OL,10,Fpeople don't look at my brand as a
OL,11,Fcelebrity brand any more."
